","id":54368340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzY4MzQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54368340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adubry75","html_url":"https://github.com/adubry75","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adubry75/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adubry75/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adubry75/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adubry75/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adubry75/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adubry75/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adubry75/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adubry75/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adubry75/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T05:38:58Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T05:39:51Z","body":"I was having this issue and corrected it by turning on Single Window Mode. Here's an excerpt from my post on the forum just a moment ago:\n\n\"After trying the Single Window Mode fix (Go to Editor → Editor Settings, and then in the Modal popup, under the General tab expand “Interface” and click “Editor” and find “Single Window Mode” (or just search for ‘window’ in the search box) and even though it SAYS ON (kind of a dumb interface), you have to check the box next to it and then it tells you to click the Restart button in the modal to restart the editor and yep, I worked for 30 minutes with NO crashes!! nice.\"\n\nFrom this forum page:\nhttps://forum.godotengine.org/t/godot-freezing-and-crashing-constantly/102897/14","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820127384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820845546","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105614#issuecomment-2820845546","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105614","id":2820845546,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oIq_q","user":{"login":"CatNuton","id":88935830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4OTM1ODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88935830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatNuton","html_url":"https://github.com/CatNuton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatNuton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatNuton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatNuton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatNuton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatNuton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatNuton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatNuton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatNuton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatNuton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-22T10:12:46Z","updated_at":"2025-04-22T10:12:46Z","body":"Guy! Thank you so much! What would I do without you and the guy from the forum)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2820845546/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825068055","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105614#issuecomment-2825068055","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105614","id":2825068055,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oYx4X","user":{"login":"cousinbenson","id":7032988,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMzI5ODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7032988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cousinbenson","html_url":"https://github.com/cousinbenson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cousinbenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cousinbenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cousinbenson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cousinbenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cousinbenson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cousinbenson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cousinbenson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cousinbenson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cousinbenson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T17:47:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T18:04:39Z","body":"@CatNuton i dont think we should close this issue, this seems to be a bug. Enabling Single Window Mode does fix the crashing, but you lose access to the game preview task bar which is new to 4.4.\n\nAfter a little more testing it seems chaning the backend to d3d12 also fixes the crashing (and you can keep the toolbar), however default godot behavior is Vulkan with no Single Window mode, so i would still mark this as a bug.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825068055/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2826587650","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105614#issuecomment-2826587650","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/